comments.body:
@KaiErikNiermann no solution is given in that thread. In general, there is no reason to expect that a user of `rich` will have access to the full logging stack, including  those of imported modules. 

Even if we do assume that the user has access, then we need a way to systematically enumerate the `StreamHandler` objects, determine whether they're using stale references to `sys.stderr` or `sys.stdout` or some other pipe, and replace them as appropriate.

No solution has yet been given for this, as far as I'm aware.
